    "status": "present",
    "value": "A safe opens when its last n entered digits equal the secret password. Digits range over 0..k-1, and the password has exactly n digits. Return any shortest string of digits that, when typed in, is guaranteed to open the safe at some point whatever the password is; that is, every possible n-digit password appears as a contiguous substring."
  },
